# Requirements - ICTServe Frontend Mockup

## Document Information
- **Version:** 1.0.0
- **Date:** 2025-11-28
- **Status:** Draft
- **References:** D00, D12, D13, D14

## 1. Functional Requirements

### FR-1: Guest Landing Page
**Description:** The landing page must present a clean, accessible interface for guest users (MOTAC staff) to access Helpdesk and Asset Loan services.

**Requirements:**
- **FR-1.1:** Display "Sistem Perkhidmatan ICT" as the main heading
- **FR-1.2:** Show 3 interactive cards: Aduan ICT, Pinjaman Aset, Semak Status
- **FR-1.3:** Aduan ICT card links to `route('helpdesk.submit')`
- **FR-1.4:** Pinjaman Aset card links to `route('loan.guest.create')`
- **FR-1.5:** Semak Status card contains input field for ticket/loan reference number

### FR-2: Header Navigation
**Description:** Sticky header with MOTAC branding and navigation.

**Requirements:**
- **FR-2.1:** Display MOTAC BPM logo/text on the left
- **FR-2.2:** Navigation links: "Utama", "Semak Status", "Direktori"
- **FR-2.3:** Language switcher (BM | EN) on the right
- **FR-2.4:** Responsive hamburger menu for mobile devices
- **FR-2.5:** Staff login link or Dashboard link (for authenticated users)

### FR-3: Footer
**Description:** Simple footer with copyright and social media links.

**Requirements:**
- **FR-3.1:** Copyright text: "© 2025 BPM MOTAC"
- **FR-3.2:** Social media icons with proper alt text
- **FR-3.3:** Responsive layout for mobile/tablet

## 2. Non-Functional Requirements

### NFR-1: Accessibility (WCAG 2.2 AA)
**Requirements:**
- **NFR-1.1:** Color contrast minimum 4.5:1 for text, 3:1 for UI components
- **NFR-1.2:** Keyboard navigation fully accessible (Tab, Shift+Tab, Enter, Escape)
- **NFR-1.3:** Focus indicators visible (3px outline, 2-4px offset)
- **NFR-1.4:** All form inputs have associated labels
- **NFR-1.5:** Touch targets minimum 44×44px
- **NFR-1.6:** Screen reader compatible (ARIA landmarks, roles, labels)

### NFR-2: Performance
**Requirements:**
- **NFR-2.1:** Page load time < 3 seconds
- **NFR-2.2:** Use Tailwind CSS utility classes (avoid arbitrary values where possible)
- **NFR-2.3:** Optimize images and assets

### NFR-3: Responsive Design
**Requirements:**
- **NFR-3.1:** Grid layout adapts to breakpoints: 320px, 768px, 1024px, 1920px
- **NFR-3.2:** Cards stack vertically on mobile
- **NFR-3.3:** Navigation collapses to hamburger menu on mobile

### NFR-4: Branding
**Requirements:**
- **NFR-4.1:** Use MOTAC primary blue: `#0056b3` (6.8:1 contrast on white)
- **NFR-4.2:** Use secondary blue: `#0B4D8F` for hover states
- **NFR-4.3:** Use success green: `#198754`, warning orange: `#ff8c00`, danger red: `#b50c0c`
- **NFR-4.4:** Typography: Open Sans or Roboto, 16px minimum base

## 3. Technical Requirements

### TR-1: Technology Stack
- **TR-1.1:** Laravel 12.x with Blade templating
- **TR-1.2:** Tailwind CSS v3 for styling
- **TR-1.3:** Alpine.js v3 for lightweight interactivity
- **TR-1.4:** Livewire v3 for language switcher component

### TR-2: Browser Compatibility
- **TR-2.1:** Chrome 120+
- **TR-2.2:** Firefox 120+
- **TR-2.3:** Safari 17+
- **TR-2.4:** Edge 120+

## 4. Standards Compliance

### SC-1: ISO Standards
- **ISO 9241-210:** Human-centred design
- **ISO 9241-110:** Dialogue principles
- **ISO 9241-11:** Usability

### SC-2: WCAG 2.2 Level AA
- **Perceivable:** Color, contrast, alt text, captions
- **Operable:** Keyboard navigation, focus visible, no keyboard trap
- **Understandable:** Labels, error messages, consistent terminology
- **Robust:** Semantic HTML, ARIA landmarks, screen reader compatible

## 5. User Stories

### US-1: Guest User Accesses Landing Page
**As a** MOTAC staff member  
**I want to** see a clear landing page with options for Helpdesk and Asset Loan  
**So that** I can quickly submit requests without logging in

**Acceptance Criteria:**
- Hero section displays "Sistem Perkhidmatan ICT"
- 3 cards are visible and interactive
- Language switcher is accessible
- Footer displays copyright information

### US-2: Guest User Submits Helpdesk Ticket
**As a** MOTAC staff member  
**I want to** click "Buat Aduan" on the landing page  
**So that** I can report ICT issues

**Acceptance Criteria:**
- "Buat Aduan" button redirects to `route('helpdesk.submit')`
- Button has proper focus state
- Button is touch-accessible (≥44px)

### US-3: Guest User Checks Status
**As a** MOTAC staff member  
**I want to** enter my ticket/loan reference number  
**So that** I can check the status of my request

**Acceptance Criteria:**
- Input field has proper label (sr-only or visible)
- "Semak" button triggers search
- Input validates reference format

## 6. Constraints

- **C-1:** Must use existing route names (`helpdesk.submit`, `loan.guest.create`)
- **C-2:** Must not break existing Livewire components
- **C-3:** Must not introduce new dependencies without approval
- **C-4:** Must maintain consistency with Filament admin panel design
